d anvil above), so the (1 - w) QVSW + w QVSI blend is exercised across its whole range rather than at its two endpoints. All three branches fire (12 cloud-free, 12 saturated, 35 on the fit) and both guards of the Randall arm are active in a way no other regime here reaches: the exponential argument hits its -6.9 floor in 8 layers, and 10 layers produce a fit below 0.01 and are snapped to zero. 25 layers end strictly fractional.",
